      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Welcoming Elena Pavlovna into Lyova's modest apartment, Chef Barinov claims that he shares the flat with his elderly mother and a struggling friend he generously took in. Deeply moved by his apparent kindness, Elena apologizes for misjudging him and leans in closer.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
